      "result": "Implemented the persistent URL shortener API.\n\n- Added PostgreSQL storage and migrations; `start.sh` applies pending migrations before serving on `0.0.0.0:8000`.\n- Added link creation, listing, lookup, redirect, and click tracking, including the requested validation and error responses.\n- Documented startup in the README.\n\nVerified with HTTP integration checks for creation, generated codes, duplicate and invalid inputs, redirect status and location, click counts, not-found responses, and list ordering. Restarted the server and confirmed links and click counts persisted. `start.sh` is executable. `npm test` ran successfully but currently contains no test cases.",
